189408,"en":"The strong ones are in the osher."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l033","ordinal":189409,"en":"Manchurian who threw stones"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l034","ordinal":189410,"en":"The clean ones are here."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l035","ordinal":189411,"en":"Horse player, runner,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l036","ordinal":189412,"en":"They wandered without a car"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l037","ordinal":189413,"en":"Soldier's runner,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l038","ordinal":189414,"en":"The moon ruled the universe"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0042:b004:l039","ordinal":189415,"en":"Konurbai's rebellion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l001","ordinal":189416,"en":"Inside that fortress,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l002","ordinal":189417,"en":"Beneath the golden pavilion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l003","ordinal":189418,"en":"In the imperial garden,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l004","ordinal":189419,"en":"Kongurbai was lying"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l005","ordinal":189420,"en":"At the time appointed for his leisure."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l006","ordinal":189421,"en":"A shrill cry rang out;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l007","ordinal":189422,"en":"No other living soul dared approach."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l008","ordinal":189423,"en":"One man stood there in anguish,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l009","ordinal":189424,"en":"Calling Kongurbai by name."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l010","ordinal":189425,"en":"When they heard Karagul's voice,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l011","ordinal":189426,"en":"All the guards bent low,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l012","ordinal":189427,"en":"And every messenger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l013","ordinal":189428,"en":"Ran scattering in every direction."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l014","ordinal":189429,"en":"When he heard the great uproar,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l015","ordinal":189430,"en":"His snoring ceased;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l016","ordinal":189431,"en":"Hero Kongurbai, the great Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l017","ordinal":189432,"en":"Opened his eyes wide as bowls."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l018","ordinal":189433,"en":"When he wished to step outside,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l019","ordinal":189434,"en":"And look upon the people's welfare,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l020","ordinal":189435,"en":"At the gateway door,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l021","ordinal":189436,"en":"At the opening where messengers passed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l022","ordinal":189437,"en":"By the towering watchtower,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l023","ordinal":189438,"en":"At the foot of that tower,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l024","ordinal":189439,"en":"The open field stretched broad,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0043:b003:l025","ordinal":189440,"en":"And people thronged across the expanse."}]
